WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.030
Sam is writing an
essay about the future.

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.350
He wants to say: "With more time,

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.870
I could travel the whole country.

4
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.030
" He reasons: it's about the future,

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.530
so it needs the future tense.

6
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.030
He writes: Con más tiempo,
podré viajar por todo el país.

7
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.950
That's real Spanish.

8
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.330
But does it say what Sam means?

9
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.250
Which tense does his
sentence really need?

10
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.950
In this mission, you'll see the
jobs the future does: plans,

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.720
predictions and ambitions.

12
00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:34.730
You'll meet the conditional's
jobs too, like asking politely:

13
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.010
¿Podrías ayudarme, por favor?

14
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:41.630
And you'll read sentences and
decide which tense each one needs.

15
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:46.330
Your mission: work out which
tense Sam's sentence really needs.
